        "ar": "الضريبة على الدخل الإجمالي على الأجور",
        "en": "Income tax (IRG) withheld on salaries"
      },
      "description": "Monthly IRG on a regular salary or pension, computed on the monthly taxable income (gross minus the employee's social security contribution):\n1. taxable ≤ exemption_threshold → IRG = 0 2. scale_irg = progressive monthly scale (`brackets`, upper bounds in DA, last one null = no limit) 3. abatement = scale_irg × abatement.rate, bounded to [abatement.min, abatement.max] 4. irg = scale_irg − abatement 5. if a `smoothing` entry applies to the regime and exemption_threshold < taxable < below:\n   irg = irg × multiplier − subtract  (both given as fractions [numerator, denominator])\n6. irg = max(0, irg) rounded down to `rounding.step`\nSmoothing entries are not cumulative: use the first one whose `regimes` contains the taxpayer's regime.\n",
